01:28:15.530 --> 01:28:18.470
When sometimes, Douglas, you feel the knife?

01:28:18.710 --> 01:28:20.750
What's the idea, Maliby? This isn't going to do you any good.

01:28:21.040 --> 01:28:21.800
Tell him, Douglas.

01:28:22.400 --> 01:28:25.040
Tell him how one glass of beer can add up to 12 years.

01:28:25.570 --> 01:28:26.930
Tell him the reason I'm going to kill you

01:28:26.930 --> 01:28:29.310
and why I waited for three years for the chance to do it.

01:28:30.350 --> 01:28:32.310
Just for the record, Warden, I got potty, too.

01:28:44.890 --> 01:28:47.910
Guess you can understand now why I couldn't tell you anything.

01:28:48.720 --> 01:28:51.120
Well, I still don't believe in what you did, but I suppose...

01:28:53.160 --> 01:28:55.860
Hello? Oh, hello, McKay.

01:28:57.380 --> 01:28:59.980
Yeah, you can tell Junior he can have his inquest tomorrow, and that way we can all...

01:29:00.000 --> 01:29:07.580
waste a lot of time. Why? Because I already caught the murderer, that's why. Oh, I'm

01:29:07.580 --> 01:29:12.480
going to worry an awful lot about being unorthodox. Go ahead and tell the governor he can send

01:29:12.480 --> 01:29:22.540
his investigators over. Half of them belong in here anyway. Who? What about him? He got

01:29:22.540 --> 01:29:28.150
his parole three hours ago. Sure, I signed it, and so did you.

01:29:30.090 --> 01:29:32.650
Mac, if you try anything like that, I'll go back into private practice.

01:29:32.870 --> 01:29:34.790
I'll not only make that parole stick, I'll...

01:29:35.680 --> 01:29:38.360
Look, my resignation is signed and right here on my desk.

01:29:38.520 --> 01:29:41.680
If Mitchell or anybody else isn't satisfied, all they have to do is come over and pick it up.

01:29:42.520 --> 01:29:45.040
No, no, I'm not sore. I just love this job.

01:29:53.100 --> 01:29:53.940
Two or three hours ago.

01:29:55.000 --> 01:29:55.880
A little behind schedule.

01:29:56.840 --> 01:29:58.520
You better get started. I'll drive you to the train.

01:29:58.680 --> 01:29:59.980
When I start to end a living...

01:30:01.760 --> 01:30:03.700
You won't mind if I write your daughter, will you?

01:30:11.950 --> 01:30:14.780
Kay, get your coat and meet me at the car.

01:30:16.810 --> 01:30:18.110
Be sure and get her forwarding address.

01:30:19.070 --> 01:30:20.970
We'll all be sprung from this place about the same time.
